d:A regional substation breaker tripped without warning. You have console access to Velkarion Mobile's signaling investigation tool and a forensic bundle from the substation's IEC 60870-5-104 network. Reconstruct what happened and who is responsible.

<br>

Endpoint: GET /events for the flagged-signaling feed; start at GET /files/ for the case-file index and report contract; submit the completed report to POST /submit.

Flag format: `CSCTF{...}`
